<title>USA: RTRS-Western Mining raises US$400 million.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Western Mining raises US$400 million.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following two-tranche debt issue from WMC Finance USA Ltd, a unit of Western Mining Corp Holdings Ltd, was priced on Thursday, according to lead manager Merrill Lynch &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER WMC FINANCE USA LTD</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	 COUPON 6.75 PCT   MATURITY 12/01/2006</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.381  FIRST PAY DATE N.A.</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A2    YIELD  6.837 PCT  PAY FREQ	 N.A.</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-A  SPREAD 63 BP	CALLABLE	 NO</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	 COUPON 7.35 PCT   MATURITY 12/01/2026</p>
<p>TYPE DEBENTURES    ISS PRICE 99.739  FIRST PAY DATE N.A.</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A2    YIELD  7.372 PCT  PAY FREQ	 N.A.</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-A  SPREAD 82 BP	CALLABLE	 NO</p>
<p>-- U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
